  {
   "day": 86,
   "line": "⛓️ Nathan brings it home: Emberhold bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."
  },
  {
   "day": 91,
   "line": "🌾 Tribute wagons from Emberhold turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 98,
   "line": "🌾 Tribute wagons from Emberhold turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "line": "🌾 Tribute wagons from Emberhold turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 107,
   "line": "◈ SYSTEM: \"One fire was a village. Two fires is a NETWORK. Coordination layer: online — tribute, demands, the long climb, all tracked now. Try not to starve twice as fast.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 112,
   "line": "🌾 Nothing comes from Emberhold this week — their fields are as empty as the wagons look. Hunger isn't defiance, but the ledger doesn't know the difference. (Arrears +4,000 kcal, trust -2.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 119,
   "line": "🌾 Nothing comes from Emberhold this week — their fields are as empty as the wagons look. Hunger isn't defiance, but the ledger doesn't know the difference. (Arrears +4,000 kcal, trust -2.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 119,
   "line": "Emberhold watches to see if Haven holds without its dead — and presses the tribute down to 3,000 kcal/week while the chair is empty. They'll test the link. Count on it."
  },
  {
   "day": 126,
   "line": "🌾 Nothing comes from Emberhold this week — their fields are as empty as the wagons look. Hunger isn't defiance, but the ledger doesn't know the difference. (Arrears +3,000 kcal, trust -2.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 128,
   "line": "Emberhold watches to see if Haven holds without its dead — and presses the tribute down to 2,250 kcal/week while the chair is empty. They'll test the link. Count on it."
  },
  {
   "day": 128,
   "line": "In the chaos, the neglected link snaps — no tribute, no deeds, no one left who kept it. Nobody meant it. That's how these things go."
  }
